{"ID":"20240522195540-zfzwyix","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","icon":"1f3b8","id":"20240522195540-zfzwyix","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522195540-zfzwyix\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522195558-c3o3pb8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522195600-lgeol9i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522195558-k7bsa51\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:108\u0026#125;","title":"17.人間最壞的就是維他命","type":"doc","updated":"20240523094259"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522195558-c3o3pb8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-c3o3pb8","updated":"20240522195558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Subject:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《維他命-芬蘭政府實驗報告》"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-ze5530z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-ze5530z","updated":"20240522195622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最流行的維骨力一樣，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"吃太多其實因為軟骨增生過多，進而形成骨刺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":", 所以維他命的相關藥品或食品，其實不能吃太多 , "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"天然的最好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-k7bsa51","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-k7bsa51","updated":"20240522195908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"芬蘭政府耗資4300萬美金所做的一個實驗，是全世界最大的維他命實驗，用了29000人，高達5－8年之時間，找集了20000多人（"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"吸煙的人"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"），讓他們每天吃維他命A與維他命E，另一組（控制組）則沒吃。過了5年，8年，發現"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"每天吃維他命A與維他命E的這些人得到癌症、死於癌症的比率高出18%。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"更重要的，他們發現現有吃維他命E的這些人得到心臟病、死於心臟病的比率比控制組高出50%。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-6q32e8w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-6q32e8w","updated":"20240522195558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這樣的一個報告出來以後，科學家們的臉不知要往哪擺！因為我們一直以為從小型實驗室的研究，不是發現維他命E能防止我們的血管硬化？應可以防止心臟病，為何在此一個大的實驗，且是政府做的實驗，會給我們一個完全相反的效果！"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-674lau5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-674lau5","updated":"20240522195904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"此時美國的食品藥物管理署（FDA）就出來做解釋，Dr. Victor Herbert 他說："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-10s3ifm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-10s3ifm","updated":"20240522195856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"『當一個維他命含在一個橘子裡時，我們稱它為一個抗氧化劑（antioxidant），可以防止心臟病，防止癌症，對我們的身體是有好處的，但是當此維他命C離開這個橘子以後，這個維他命C它就稱為 prooxidant，也就會製造上億以上的自由基，此會造成心臟病、癌症，對我們的身體是有害的』。所以，維他命本身有此兩種型態。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"橘子是神造的，維他命C是人造的。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"人造的比不上神造的。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-vv30lah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-vv30lah","updated":"20240522195558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"身為一個科學家，是絕對無法走進實驗是創造出一個橘子，一粒蕃茄的。"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-tpv59bu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-tpv59bu","updated":"20240522195558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在一個橘子，一個蕃茄裡面，含有很多種的營養素，如今，我們連這一萬多種營養素，是那些營養素都不清楚，我們哪來的智慧與權利來告訴社會大眾，其中最重要的營養素是維他命呢？我們還沒有這樣一個智慧與權利。"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-bu4ubsg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-bu4ubsg","updated":"20240522195558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一個完整的食物才是真正的營養。"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-yvvo5p0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-yvvo5p0","updated":"20240522195849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我們人常常有一個比較不好的習慣，那就是任何我們聽不懂得名字，就會認為它比較好，台灣沒有的東西我們也會覺得它比較好一點。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-cibg8r0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-cibg8r0","updated":"20240522195839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如廣告上新的化學名稱就會認為它比較好一點，例如蛋白質、安基酸、酵素、抗氧化劑，此一系列各種各類的化學名稱，我們沒聽過的就認為它比較好，但對於我來說，我不認為它們不好，而是我比較關心"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"我們是如何把這些維他命C從一個橘子裡拿出來？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-spq35le","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-spq35le","updated":"20240522195558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"讓我來問你一個問題："}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-xs543wh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-xs543wh","updated":"20240522195558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你要喝有咖啡因的咖啡還是沒有咖啡因的咖啡？"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-w81ijk0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-w81ijk0","updated":"20240522195558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意聽喔！不要喝有咖啡因的咖啡。因有咖啡因的咖啡會刺激中央神經系統的，心跳速度加快，還有會增加皺紋。"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-nyl7znr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-nyl7znr","updated":"20240522195657"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"但更不要喝沒有咖啡因的咖啡。因為把咖啡因拿出來要用一種化學藥品，此化學藥品已被證明為致癌的化學藥品"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以今日美國的衛生局已禁用，現在是用第二種的化學藥品。所以並不是咖啡因有多麼不好，而是如何把它拿出來的問題。"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-m48flx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-m48flx0","updated":"20240522195826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"今天美國的衛生局向國會提出一個專案，希望美國國會把維他命和礦物質的東西列為藥品，讓所有的人無法在市面上自由的購買到。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這是美國的政策。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-zx130xi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-zx130xi","updated":"20240522195830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"因為他們發現維他命帶來很多的副作用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"，所以美國衛生現在印出很多的小冊子上面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寫著："}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-n908mud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-n908mud","updated":"20240522195831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"美國每年有30000多個兒童在母親認為維他命沒有副作用而大量給小孩吃，結果導致中毒現象。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-b0hqg57","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-b0hqg57","updated":"20240522195558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今天維他命的使用量是依大人的量而定，而非依小孩來定，所以小孩來吃是過量的。"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-cfwq2dr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-cfwq2dr","updated":"20240522195707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"另外，當我們體內有過多的維他命C時，血液的鐵質會上升，很容易得到心臟病和癌症。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-w35zdef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-w35zdef","updated":"20240522195708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"同時我們也發現過多的維他命E會造成關節炎。過多的維他命D會造成肝的受損。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-uraicyt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-uraicyt","updated":"20240522195710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"過多的維他命B12會造成中央神經系統的損壞。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-nxa4lsv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-nxa4lsv","updated":"20240522195558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"轉寄只為好東西與好朋友分享，每一封信，都帶著我對您的祝福"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-2ughq8o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-2ughq8o","updated":"20240522195711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-zpx7pdz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-zpx7pdz","updated":"20240522195721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    當讀者看到這篇報導後，是否覺得很眼熟呢，我ㄧ直就在罵維他命的壞處，尤其是會餵食癌症的部份，可是有多少人願意相信呢？其一開始就談到有關維骨力的藥物時，這種藥除了 上述中說的會讓骨刺增生之外，我還看過長期服用它的病人，有許多都已經得到多發性骨髓瘤，這種藥跟鈣片一樣，不但不能補骨，反而會讓骨質增生，餵食骨髓瘤的癌細胞，也就是說本來沒病的人，吃了它之後，就很可能會有機會得到多發性骨髓瘤，其他的各種維他命當然是只能給你的敵人吃的，自己絕對不要吃，吃多了就會得到癌症而更短命，世間最差的研究就是關於維他命的研究，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"現在台灣政府居然還要將低劑量的維他命當成食品來賣"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，也就是說人人都隨時隨地可以買到，明明就不是食品，卻要當成食品來賣， 這是倒行逆施的昏庸政策，如果這種害人民生病的政策不改變，台灣百姓必將更短命，從此以後台灣不單是肝癌世界排名第一，是所有的癌症都將世界排名第一了。"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-rgudel8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-rgudel8","updated":"20240522195726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"    我早就說過，天下最好的營養劑就是正常的食物，大家多吃世界各國的各種菜與水果就好了。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-df910g8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-df910g8","updated":"20240522195807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"現在台灣衛生署開放一些維他命列為食品，可以自由販售，他們的意思就是維他命是食品"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（倪海厦-其他-搜索\u0026quot;高劑量維他命 才算藥品\u0026quot;）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"，大家可以不用吃台灣美食了，光吃維他命就夠了。這是害人生病又短命的政策。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522195558-tm29klj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195558-tm29klj","updated":"20240522195558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年04月17日"}]},{"ID":"20240522195559-lqz04h7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522195559-lqz04h7"}},{"ID":"20240522195600-lgeol9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522195600-lgeol9i"}}]}